WEBVTT

00:02:58.091 --> 00:03:00.214
and, unlike any other job in our government,

00:03:00.214 --> 00:03:02.883
Supreme Court justices are appointed for life,

00:03:02.883 --> 00:03:05.176
or for as long as they want to stay.

00:03:05.176 --> 00:03:08.132
Our democracy depends on an informed citizenry,

00:03:08.132 --> 00:03:10.140
so it is our duty to know how it works

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:12.475
and what authority each branch of government has

00:03:12.475 --> 00:03:13.682
over its citizens.

00:03:13.682 --> 00:03:14.811
Besides voting,

00:03:14.811 --> 00:03:16.729
chances are that some time in your life

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:19.355
you'll be called upon to participate in your government,

00:03:19.355 --> 00:03:21.151
whether it is to serve on a jury,

00:03:21.151 --> 00:03:22.361
testify in court,

00:03:22.361 --> 00:03:24.193
or petition your Congress person

00:03:24.193 --> 00:03:26.711
to pass or defeat an idea for a law.

00:03:26.711 --> 00:03:27.855
By knowning the branches,

00:03:27.855 --> 00:03:28.718
who runs them,

00:03:28.718 --> 00:03:29.993
and how they work together,

00:03:29.993 --> 00:03:31.077
you can be involved,